<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia April palm oil export duties.</title>
<headline>Malaysia April palm oil export duties.</headline>
<text>
<p>(All quoted in ringgit/tonne)</p>
<p>Products		     Value		   Duty</p>
<p>				April    (March)     April  (March)</p>
